  "description": "# SIP2.7: Add 1 Ark to LazyVault_HigherRisk_WETH Fleet on mainnet\n\n## Summary\nThis is a cross-chain governance proposal to add 1 new Ark to the existing LazyVault_HigherRisk_WETH Fleet on mainnet.\n\n## Motivation\nExpanding this fleet with additional an Ark will enhance the protocol's capabilities on mainnet.\n\n## Technical Details\n- Hub Chain: base (Production)\n- Target Chain: mainnet\n- Fleet Commander: 0x2E6abcbCCeD9Af05bc3B8a4908e0c98c29A88e10\n- Number of Ark to add: 1\n\n## New Ark Address\n1. `0xFC53Cd3Bd3E700ca3154D620C8d8806178dcc166`\n\n## Specifications\n### Actions\nThis proposal will execute the following actions on mainnet:\n1. Grant COMMANDER_ROLE to Fleet Commander for the Ark\n2. Add the Ark to the Fleet Commander\n\n### Cross-chain Mechanism\nThis proposal uses LayerZero to execute governance actions across chains.\n\n## References\nDiscourse: https://forum.summer.fi/t/sip2-7-integrate-morpho-smokehouse-eth-as-a-new-ark-in-summer-eth-vault/227\n",
